# Calendar (new)

Purpose: time as the organizing axis — instances plotted by a date
field, optionally several concepts overlaid (launches + interviews +
renewals on one grid). Exists because lists answer "what"; calendars
answer "when", and deadline-shaped work is invisible without one.

Size/position: drag + resize on the canvas (dnd), never in the menu.
Relevancy: 🔥 core · ⭐ valuable · 💤 later

